title: "Atlas of Proteomic Technologies (APT)"
abstract: >-
  An interactive reference and decision-support tool for selecting and
  combining commercial high-plex proteomics platforms, with two transparent
  recommendation engines and full reproducibility bundles for their fairness
  analyses.
type: software
authors:
